ges, and powerful foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explicit adult content</strong>, available through storyline events, character interactions, or defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-animated NSFW scenes</strong>, fully optional and player-triggered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Retro-style visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759840/extras/46176111c3cccf8d0ccb99d6aedf1616.poster.avif?t=1755784537\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759840/extras/46176111c3cccf8d0ccb99d6aedf1616.webm?t=1755784537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759840/extras/46176111c3cccf8d0ccb99d6aedf1616.mp4?t=1755784537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
